## New Section 17: Dual-Mode Editor Specification

### 17.1 Mode Selection

- Shown once when creating a post/guide/review
- Two options: **Story** (long-form writing) or **Design** (visual canvas)
- Mode is **locked** at creation - no conversion

### 17.2 Story Mode

- TipTap-based rich text editor
- Continuous flowing text
- Can embed canvas windows inline
- Canvas windows are fully editable (not static snapshots)
- Window resize scales internal content

### 17.3 Design Mode

- Full canvas (Canva-style)
- Fixed design width (800px), infinite height
- All elements movable, resizable, rotatable
- Rich text elements with TipTap formatting inside
- Snap-to-grid + alignment guides
- Multi-select (shift-click, marquee drag)
- Grouping (groupId on elements)

### 17.4 Shared Element Types

| Element | Features |
|---------|----------|
| Text | Rich text (TipTap), font, color, size, bold/italic, alignment |
| Image | Upload/URL, crop/reposition, opacity |
| Shape | Square, circle, diamond, line, fill, border, radius |
| Button | Label, URL, open-in-new-tab, styling |
| Checklist | Visual list with checkboxes (interactive) |
| PDF | Inline preview + download |
| Divider | Horizontal line |
| Portal Dates | Shows departure/return/countdown |
| Portal Notices | Shows notices with filtering |
| Portal Documents | Shows documents with download |
| Portal FAQs | Shows FAQs with expand/collapse |

### 17.5 Shared Styling

Every element supports:
- Fill color (full hex picker)
- Border width + color
- Border radius
- Transparency (opacity)
- Font (text elements)
- Text color
- Text size
- Bold/italic/alignment
- Layer controls (forward/backward)

### 17.6 Page Styling

Both modes support:
- Background color
- Background image
- Background transparency
- Page padding

### 17.7 Templates

- Save as template captures snapshot of elements
- Applying template copies elements as editable starting point
- Templates are independent (editing post doesn't affect template)
- Stored in template picker/manager UI

### 17.8 Undo/Redo

- Global undo stack (capped 50)
- Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y
- Nudge operations create undo points

### 17.9 Keyboard Shortcuts

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| Ctrl+Z | Undo |
| Ctrl+Y / Ctrl+Shift+Z | Redo |
| Ctrl+C / Ctrl+V | Copy/paste |
| Delete/Backspace | Delete selected |
| Arrow keys | Nudge (1px or 10px with shift) |
| Escape | Deselect all |

### 17.10 Autosave

- 2s debounce
- Shows "Saving..." / "Saved" / "Save failed" status
- Flush on unmount

